'''Teacher Bun Bun''' (ぶんぶん先生, ''Bun Bun-sensei'', '''Teacher Bun Bun''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy first seen as the boss of the [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon/Iriomote]] stage in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3. He was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]].

